{"title":"Christmas Wreath","slug":"Christmas_Wreath","hero":null,"pageid":1954,"revid":11202,"timestamp":"2024-03-17T19:18:51Z","lastEditor":"TheFlyFella","categories":["Items","Event_Items"],"infobox":{"type":"Axe","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay"},{"label":"Shop","value":"The Oak Depot"},{"label":"Price","value":"$1,045"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"1.45.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"12/10/23"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"},{"id":"gallery","text":"Gallery"}],"body":"<i><big>\"Decorate your space with this festive wreath.\"</big></i>\n\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>The <b>Christmas Wreath</b> is a decorational item introduced in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Update_Log%2FVersion_1.45.0/\">v1.45.0</a>. It is temporarily purchasable at the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/The_Oak_Depot/\"><b>Oak Depot</b></a>. This item can also spawn in <b>Gift Landings</b>, the <b>Christmas Update</b>'s version of <b><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Meteor_Core/\">Meteor Crashes</a></b>.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>\n<ul><li>This item is based off of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wreath\">Wreaths</a> <i>(Wikipedia link)</i> in real life, commonly used during Christmas.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"gallery\">Gallery</h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"d3ef8fda9068b9df8e2b12e399ded67d\" data-seq-no=\"1\"><div></div><div><div><div id=\"Christmas_Wreath_in_Oak_Depot-png\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"><noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Christmas Wreath in Oak Depot\">Christmas Wreath in Oak Depot</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Christmas Wreath in Oak Depot\">Christmas Wreath in Oak Depot</span></span></div></div><div>Christmas Wreath in Oak Depot</div></div></div>"}
